               <history>
                  <origin>
                     <origPlace>
                        <placeName ref="INS0232TKMG"/>
                     </origPlace>
                     <origDate notBefore="1671" notAfter="1675">Patriarch of Alexandria (liqa
                        ṗāṗāsāt) <persName ref="PRS6906Matthew"><roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Mātewos</persName>  (in tenure <date notBefore="1660" notAfter="1675"/>), 
                        Metropolitan (ṗāṗās) <persName ref="PRS8870Sinoda"><roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Sinodā</persName> (in tenure <date notBefore="1671" notAfter="1692"/>) 
                        and <persName ref="PRS10375Yohanne"><roleName type="title">King</roleName> Yoḥannǝs I</persName> (r. <date notBefore="1667" notAfter="1682"/>) are
                        mentioned in the supplications on <locus target="#52ra"/>. 
                        <persName ref="PRS10375Yohanne"><roleName type="title">King</roleName> Yoḥannǝs I</persName>is also mentioned in the supplication on <locus target="#55rb"/> 
                        and Metropolitan <persName ref="PRS8870Sinoda"><roleName type="title">ʾAbbā</roleName> Sinodā</persName> on <locus target="#56ra"/>.</origDate>
                  </origin>
                  <provenance>The name(s) of the original supplicant(s) has been
                     erased throughout the manuscript and replaced with the names of ʾAśrāta Māryām,
                     ʾAśrāta Ṣǝyon and Ṣǝge Dǝngǝl in the concluding supplication on 73vb. Their names and one more name have been also
                     added into the supplication formulas: ʾAśrāta Māryām (<locus target="#3ra #40rb, #51rb #51va #62rb #62va #65ra"/>), 
                     ʾAśrāta Ṣǝyon (<locus target="#39va #62ra #62va #65ra"/>), Māryāmāwit (<locus target="#31ra #39vb #63ra"/>) and Ṣǝge Dǝngǝl (<locus target="#57vb #61va #64vb"/>), 
                     in a secondary hand not much later than <ref target="#h2"/>, in vivid
                     red.</provenance></history>
